From f82b44950e799f836975c41e61a93e2b1e0fcfdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:14:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(hud): dock quick-launch slots and assignable labelled
 plates

- `dock` in config.json sets what the four icons under the Google box
  open (default: Downloads). An empty slot says so in the status bar.
- The gear opens config.json in the default editor.
- `plates` puts a tile on any of the twelve reactor plates that carry
  design text. The text stays, the plate becomes a slot in keyboard
  navigation, and the tile leaves the open plates.
- The main process checks every id against the real tile list; unknown or
  duplicate ids become config warnings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WHMFnP6AGkBg7uWGKH7LpK
